PFA Tube 

 RUNZE PFA tube is fully transparent rigid fluoropolymer tubing designed for high-purity and chemically demanding fluid paths. The combination of chemical resistance, broad continuous-use temperature range and controlled inner and outer diameters makes it suitable for transferring reagents, samples, ultrapure water and process chemicals in analytical and industrial fluid systems.The series includes 19 ID/OD combinations from 0.5 x 1.6 mm to 8.0 x 10.0 mm. Smaller sizes use dimensional tolerances of ±0.05 mm, while selected larger sizes use ±0.15 mm. Multiple models can be supplied with flanging service and matched to RUNZE rigid-tube fittings for system integration. 




















































